    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Canonical key</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/isomorphic-strings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 205</a></div>\n  <h1>Isomorphic Strings</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the character mapping must be a bijection, so keep two tables (s &rarr; t and t &rarr; s) and reject the first pair that contradicts either one. O(n) time, O(1) space (two 256-entry tables for ASCII).</p>\n"
